Route15_Text_SchoolboyKippIntro::
	.string "Hang on. I have to phone my Mom.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyKippDefeat::
	.string "Sorry, Mom!\n"
	.string "I was beaten!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyKipp::
	.string "My Mom worries so much about me, I\n"
	.string "have to phone her all the time.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyTommyIntro::
	.string "Let’s battle.\n"
	.string "I won’t lose!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyTommyDefeat::
	.string "I forgot to do my homework!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyTommy::
	.string "Sayonara! I just learned that in my\n"
	.string "Japanese class.$"

Route15_Text_TeacherHillaryIntro::
	.string "On sunny days, I think that the\n"
	.string "kids would rather be playing in the\l"
	.string "schoolyard than studying in class.$"

Route15_Text_TeacherHillaryDefeat::
	.string "I didn’t want to lose...$"

Route15_Text_TeacherHillary::
	.string "Studying is important, but exercise\n"
	.string "is just as vital.$"

Route15_Text_TeacherColetteIntro::
	.string "Have you forgotten anything?$"

Route15_Text_TeacherColetteDefeat::
	.string "Kyaaah!$"

Route15_Text_TeacherColette::
	.string "Before I became a teacher, I used to\n"
	.string "forget a lot of things.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyJohnnyIntro::
	.string "We’re on a field trip to LAVENDER\n"
	.string "RADIO TOWER for social studies.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyJohnnyDefeat::
	.string "You’re wickedly tough!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyJohnny::
	.string "I’m tired of walking. I need to\n"
	.string "take a break.$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyBillyIntro::
	.string "My favorite class is gym!$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyBillyDefeat::
	.string "Oh, no!\n"
	.string "How could I lose?$"

Route15_Text_SchoolboyBilly::
	.string "If POKéMON were a subject at school,\n"
	.string "I’d be the best!$"

Route15_Text_Sign::
	.string "ROUTE 15\n"
	.string "FUCHSIA CITY - LAVENDER TOWN$"
